{"id":"4352151ad508938d","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-thm-MM.md","title":"Martin's Maximum","display":"thm-MM — Martin's Maximum","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-MM","aliases":["58-thm-MM","Martin's Maximum","MM","Maximum Forcing Axiom"],"display":"thm-MM — Martin's Maximum","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-forcing8-forcing-axiom]]","[[58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset]]","[[58-df-zfc-forcing-stationary-set-preserving-poset]]","[[58-thm-stationary-set-preservation]]","[[58-thm-pfa]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-MM"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-MM</span><span>Martin's Maximum</span><span>MM</span><span>Maximum Forcing Axiom</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-MM — Martin's Maximum"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"287ea7fe632b00c1\" href=\"?note=287ea7fe632b00c1\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing8-forcing-axiom\">58-df-zfc-forcing8-forcing-axiom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b5833df5ef175153\" href=\"?note=b5833df5ef175153\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset\">58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1cd156e08cdc8ce0\" href=\"?note=1cd156e08cdc8ce0\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing-stationary-set-preserving-poset\">58-df-zfc-forcing-stationary-set-preserving-poset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ea0273e09df3b6b3\" href=\"?note=ea0273e09df3b6b3\" title=\"58-thm-stationary-set-preservation\">58-thm-stationary-set-preservation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f4fc856eb9fe0887\" href=\"?note=f4fc856eb9fe0887\" title=\"58-thm-pfa\">58-thm-pfa</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SSPForcingCode}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\">\\(\\mathrm{SSPForcingCode}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProperForcingCode}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProperForcingCode}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8ForcingAxiom}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8ForcingAxiom}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingStationarySetPreservingPoset}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingStationarySetPreservingPoset}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P,P,\\leq_P,1_P,\\Gamma\\in V\">\\(\\mathbb P,P,\\leq_P,1_P,\\Gamma\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SSPForcingCode}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SSPForcingCode}_S\\)</span> is the unary code predicate defined here</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProperForcingCode}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ProperForcingCode}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PFA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PFA}\\)</span> are imported from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f4fc856eb9fe0887\" href=\"?note=f4fc856eb9fe0887\" title=\"58-thm-pfa\">58-thm-pfa</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MM}\">\\(\\mathrm{MM}\\)</span> is the displayed first-order sentence abbreviation</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ssp\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}code}\\vdash{}\n\\mathrm{SSPForcingCode}_S(\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists P,\\leq_P,1_P\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_P,1_P\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,1_P)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingStationarySetPreservingPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\omega_1)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ssp\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}code}\\vdash{}\n\\mathrm{SSPForcingCode}_S(\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists P,\\leq_P,1_P\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_P,1_P\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,1_P)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingStationarySetPreservingPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\omega_1)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}MM}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MM}\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\Gamma\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl(\\forall\\mathbb P\\in\\Gamma\\;\\mathrm{SSPForcingCode}_S(\\mathbb P)\\bigr)\n\\to\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8ForcingAxiom}_S(\\Gamma,\\omega_1)\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}MM}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MM}\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\Gamma\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl(\\forall\\mathbb P\\in\\Gamma\\;\\mathrm{SSPForcingCode}_S(\\mathbb P)\\bigr)\n\\to\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8ForcingAxiom}_S(\\Gamma,\\omega_1)\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}proper\\text{-}codes\\text{-}are\\text{-}ssp}\\vdash\n\\forall\\mathbb P\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ProperForcingCode}_S(\\mathbb P)\n\\to\\mathrm{SSPForcingCode}_S(\\mathbb P)\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}proper\\text{-}codes\\text{-}are\\text{-}ssp}\\vdash\n\\forall\\mathbb P\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ProperForcingCode}_S(\\mathbb P)\n\\to\\mathrm{SSPForcingCode}_S(\\mathbb P)\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}MM\\text{-}implies\\text{-}PFA}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MM}\\to\\mathrm{PFA}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}MM\\text{-}implies\\text{-}PFA}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MM}\\to\\mathrm{PFA}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>MM is an additional forcing axiom, not a theorem of ZFC.  The universal quantification ranges over set-sized collections of SSP codes, so no proper class is used as a set argument.</li>\n<li>The imported proper-forcing preservation theorem supplies the exact bridge for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MM}\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{PFA}\">\\(\\mathrm{MM}\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{PFA}\\)</span>: every proper forcing code is stationary-set preserving.  The implication is therefore stated outright without an ill-typed class term or an unproved side-condition premise.</li>\n<li>Foreman-Magidor-Shelah: introduced MM (1988).</li>\n<li>The name “Maximum” does not by itself constitute a theorem that MM is maximal among all consistent forcing axioms.</li>\n<li>MM<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"^+\">\\(^+\\)</span> strengthens MM by requiring specified names for stationary subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span> to remain stationary in the witnessing filters.</li>\n<li>Under MM, the nonstationary ideal on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span> is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_2\">\\(\\omega_2\\)</span>-saturated.</li>\n<li>The standard consistency upper bound for MM is a supercompact cardinal.</li>\n<li>Applications: saturated ideals, reflection, determinacy consequences.</li>\n<li>MM and Woodin cardinals: deep connection.</li>\n<li>Key innovation: semiproper forcing class.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing8-forcing-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"287ea7fe632b00c1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-forcing8-forcing-axiom]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset","status":"resolved","id":"b5833df5ef175153","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing-stationary-set-preserving-poset","status":"resolved","id":"1cd156e08cdc8ce0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-forcing-stationary-set-preserving-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-thm-stationary-set-preservation","status":"resolved","id":"ea0273e09df3b6b3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-thm-stationary-set-preservation]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-thm-pfa","status":"resolved","id":"f4fc856eb9fe0887","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-thm-pfa]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-thm-pfa","status":"resolved","id":"f4fc856eb9fe0887","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ProperForcingCode}_S$ and $\\mathrm{PFA}$ are imported from [[58-thm-pfa]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{SSPForcingCode}_S\\subseteq V^{1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProperForcingCode}_S\\subseteq V^{1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8ForcingAxiom}_S\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingStationarySetPreservingPoset}_S\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb P,P,\\leq_P,1_P,\\Gamma\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SSPForcingCode}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProperForcingCode}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PFA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MM}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ssp\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}code}\\vdash{}\n\\mathrm{SSPForcingCode}_S(\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists P,\\leq_P,1_P\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&\n\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_P,1_P\\rangle\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,1_P)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingStationarySetPreservingPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\omega_1)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}MM}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MM}\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\Gamma\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl(\\forall\\mathbb P\\in\\Gamma\\;\\mathrm{SSPForcingCode}_S(\\mathbb P)\\bigr)\n\\to\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8ForcingAxiom}_S(\\Gamma,\\omega_1)\n\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}proper\\text{-}codes\\text{-}are\\text{-}ssp}\\vdash\n\\forall\\mathbb P\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ProperForcingCode}_S(\\mathbb P)\n\\to\\mathrm{SSPForcingCode}_S(\\mathbb P)\n\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}MM\\text{-}implies\\text{-}PFA}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MM}\\to\\mathrm{PFA}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MM}\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{PFA}","display":false},{"tex":"^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_2","display":false}],"bytes":3032,"backlinks":[{"id":"8f12f393ab28c4e4","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PFA}$ 与 $\\mathrm{MM}$ 分别使用 [[../batch19/58-thm-pfa.md]] 和 [[../batch19/58-thm-MM.md]] 的闭句；在理论加法实参中同样使用其展开后的公式码。"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4316","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-thm-MM.md|58-thm-MM]]（batch19）"},{"i